FFHQ-2048 (NanoPocket Enhanced) — License Notice
=================================================

This dataset is a derivative work of NVIDIA's Flickr-Faces-HQ (FFHQ) dataset,
re-mastered to 2048x2048 by NanoPocket Face Enhance.

Per FFHQ's license terms we (a) inherit the same license, and (b) clearly
indicate the changes we made.

Indicated changes
-----------------
Every image in this release has been:
  * upscaled 2x (from 1024x1024 to 2048x2048), and
  * detail-enhanced by the NanoPocket Face Enhance model.

No re-cropping, re-alignment, or content edits beyond enhancement were
performed. Filenames are preserved (00000.png .. 00999.png) so each image
maps 1:1 to the original FFHQ index.

